---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---
<Layout title="Privacy Policy — Robbie Avenaim">
  <section class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-5 py-14 sm:px-8 sm:py-20">
    <p class="eyebrow mb-3">Legal</p>
    <h1 class="mb-10 text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-5xl">Privacy Policy</h1>

    <div class="prose-body">
      <p>This website is a static portfolio site. It does not use comments, accounts, cookies for logins, or embedded trackers of its own.</p>
      <h3>Embedded content</h3>
      <p>Some project pages embed videos from YouTube and Vimeo. If you play an embedded video, that provider may collect data about your visit, use cookies, and track your interaction with the embedded content in the same way as if you had visited their site directly.</p>
      <h3>Contact</h3>
      <p>This site links out to the artist's Instagram and Facebook profiles. Interactions on those platforms are governed by their respective privacy policies.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
